my $CODE = <<'END_CODE';
hello world
foo bar baz

END_CODE

{
    desc => q{D from middle of line},
    description => <<'END_DESC',
Action: `D` deletes from cursor to end of line

Macro: `xt/visual/macros/D_midline`

**initial.png** (before):
- Line 1: `hello world`
- Line 2: `foo bar baz`
- Cursor at line 1, col 0

Keys: `6lD`

**after_action.png** (after):
- Line 1: `hello ` (trailing space preserved, `world` deleted)
- Line 2: `foo bar baz` (unchanged)
- Cursor at line 1, col 6 (end of remaining content)

END_DESC
    run => sub {
        my ($ctx) = @_;
        $ctx->buffer->set_text($CODE);
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('initial');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->keys('6lD');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('after_action');
    },
}
